**Focus Score Ring** — An animated circular progress ring (SVG) that fills to 82% with a count-up number animation. The gradient stroke goes from indigo to violet.

**Weekly Trend Sparkline** — A smooth Catmull-Rom interpolated sparkline drawn in SVG with a gradient stroke and a translucent area fill underneath. It animates by drawing the line on load, and the final data point pops in with a dot. Day labels run Mon–Today underneath, with today highlighted.

**Start Focus Button** — A gradient button with hover lift, ripple effect on click, and a Pomodoro-style 25-minute timer that appears below the card when active. Clicking again stops the session and resets.

**Dark Mode Styling** — Deep charcoal background (`#0d0f14`), card with subtle gradient and inner glow, green pulsing status indicator, and muted secondary text colors. No external images or dependencies — everything is inline SVG, CSS, and JS.

