<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Focus Dashboard</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #0b0e14;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .card {
    width: 340px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #161b26 0%, #10141d 100%);
    border: 1px solid #232a3a;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #8b95a7;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
    color: #34d399;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .score-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .ring-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ring-wrap svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }

  .ring-bg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #232a3a;
    stroke-width: 8;
  }

  .ring-fg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: url(#ringGrad);
    stroke-width: 8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 301.6;
    stroke-dashoffset: 301.6;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .score-label {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .score-value {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .score-unit {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .score-meta h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .score-meta p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #8b95a7;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .trend {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .trend-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .trend-header span:first-child {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8b95a7;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .trend-delta {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #34d399;
  }

  .trend-delta.down { color: #f87171; }

  .sparkline {
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    display: block;
  }

  .spark-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: url(#sparkGrad);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .spark-fill {
    fill: url(#sparkFill);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .spark-dot {
    fill: #38bdf8;
    stroke: #0b0e14;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .week-labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #4b5568;
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 0 2px;
  }

  .btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8 0%, #6366f1 100%);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
  }

  .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }

  .btn.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e 0%, #e11d48 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-timer {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card-header">
    <span class="card-title">Focus Score</span>
    <span class="badge" id="statusBadge">On Track</span>
  </div>

  <div class="score-section">
    <div class="ring-wrap">
      <svg width="110" height="110" viewBox="0 0 110 110">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="ringGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6366f1"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <circle class="ring-bg" cx="55" cy="55" r="48"/>
        <circle class="ring-fg" id="ringFg" cx="55" cy="55" r="48"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="score-label">
        <span class="score-value" id="scoreValue">0</span>
        <span class="score-unit">/ 100</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-meta">
      <h2 id="greeting">Good focus today</h2>
      <p id="scoreDesc">You're in the top 15% of your most productive days.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="trend">
    <div class="trend-header">
      <span>Weekly Trend</span>
      <span class="trend-delta" id="trendDelta">▲ 12%</span>
    </div>
    <svg class="sparkline" viewBox="0 0 280 60" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="sparkGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#818cf8"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="sparkFill" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8" stop-opacity="0.25"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#38bdf8" stop-opacity="0"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <path class="spark-fill" id="sparkFillPath"/>
      <path class="spark-line" id="sparkLinePath"/>
      <circle class="spark-dot" id="sparkDot" r="3.5"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="week-labels">
      <span>Mon</span><span>Tue</span><span>Wed</span><span>Thu</span><span>Fri</span><span>Sat</span><span>Sun</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button class="btn" id="startBtn">Start Focus</button>
</div>

<script>
  // ---- Data ----
  const weekScores = [62, 71, 58, 80, 74, 88, 84];
  const todayScore = 84;
  const days = ['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'];

  // ---- Animated score ring ----
  const ringFg = document.getElementById('ringFg');
  const scoreValue = document.getElementById('scoreValue');
  const circumference = 2 * Math.PI * 48; // 301.59

  setTimeout(() => {
    ringFg.style.strokeDashoffset = circumference * (1 - todayScore / 100);
  }, 150);

  // Count-up animation
  let current = 0;
  const duration = 1200;
  const startTime = performance.now();
  function animateScore(now) {
    const t = Math.min((now - startTime) / duration, 1);
    const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
    scoreValue.textContent = Math.round(eased * todayScore);
    if (t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(animateScore);
  }
  requestAnimationFrame(animateScore);

  // ---- Sparkline ----
  const W = 280, H = 60, PAD = 6;
  const min = Math.min(...weekScores);
  const max = Math.max(...weekScores);
  const pts = weekScores.map((v, i) => {
    const x = PAD + (i / (weekScores.length - 1)) * (W - PAD * 2);
    const y = H - PAD - ((v - min) / (max - min)) * (H - PAD * 2);
    return [x, y];
  });

  // Smooth curve via quadratic midpoints
  let d = `M ${pts[0][0]},${pts[0][1]}`;
  for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {
    const [x0, y0] = pts[i - 1];
    const [x1, y1] = pts[i];
    const mx = (x0 + x1) / 2;
    d += ` Q ${mx},${y0} ${mx},${(y0 + y1) / 2} Q ${mx},${y1} ${x1},${y1}`;
  }

  document.getElementById('sparkLinePath').setAttribute('d', d);
  document.getElementById('sparkFillPath').setAttribute('d', `${d} L ${pts[pts.length-1][0]},${H} L ${pts[0][0]},${H} Z`);

  // Highlight today's point
  const last = pts[pts.length - 1];
  const dot = document.getElementById('sparkDot');
  dot.setAttribute('cx', last[0]);
  dot.setAttribute('cy', last[1]);

  // Trend delta vs last week
  const delta = document.getElementById('trendDelta');
  const pct = 12; // vs previous week
  delta.textContent = `${pct >= 0 ? '▲' : '▼'} ${Math.abs(pct)}%`;
  delta.classList.toggle('down', pct < 0);

  // ---- Start Focus button ----
  const btn = document.getElementById('startBtn');
  const badge = document.getElementById('statusBadge');
  let focusing = false;
  let timer = null;
  let secondsLeft = 25 * 60;

  function fmt(s) {
    const m = Math.floor(s / 60);
    const sec = s % 60;
    return `${m}:${sec.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;
  }

  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    focusing = !focusing;
    if (focusing) {
      btn.classList.add('active');
      btn.innerHTML = 'Stop Session &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span class="btn-timer" id="timerText">' + fmt(secondsLeft) + '</span>';
      badge.textContent = 'In Session';
      badge.style.background = 'rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.12)';
      badge.style.color = '#f43f5e';
      timer = setInterval(() => {
        secondsLeft--;
        const t = document.getElementById('timerText');
        if (t) t.textContent = fmt(secondsLeft);
        if (secondsLeft <= 0) {
          clearInterval(timer);
          resetBtn();
          badge.textContent = 'Complete!';
          badge.style.background = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12)';
          badge.style.color = '#34d399';
        }
      }, 1000);
    } else {
      resetBtn();
    }
  });

  function resetBtn() {
    clearInterval(timer);
    focusing = false;
    secondsLeft = 25 * 60;
    btn.classList.remove('active');
    btn.textContent = 'Start Focus';
    badge.textContent = 'On Track';
    badge.style.background = '';
    badge.style.color = '';
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>
```

**Features included:**

- **Daily focus score** — animated count-up number inside a gradient SVG progress ring that fills on load
- **Weekly trend sparkline** — smooth SVG curve with gradient stroke, subtle area fill underneath, a highlighted dot on today's data point, day labels, and a ▲/▼ week-over-week delta indicator
- **Start Focus button** — fully functional: clicking it starts a mock 25-minute Pomodoro countdown (the button turns red and shows a live timer), clicking again stops/resets, and completing the session updates the status badge
- **Dark mode styling** — layered dark gradients, subtle border, soft glow shadows, and a status badge that changes color based on state

Just save it as an `.html` file and open it in any browser — everything is inline, no external dependencies or images.

